{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b95a6776-8e6a-8bfb-a342-bcbd2bf86311",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T11:27:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilson Rocha",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise. My name is Nilson Rocha. I am calling about a crosswalk. The paint is very faded, you can almost not see it, and the cars they do not stop for the people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know which street it's on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is on Thames Street, near the corner with Memorial Boulevard, by the little crossing there. I manage a building close by, so I pass every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Thames by Memorial. And it's the crosswalk lines themselves that are worn off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. Worn off. And a neighbor, she almost was hit there last week. The car did not see her. Well, the car hit her bag, I think, not her. But it was close. So it is not only me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:25:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm glad she's okay. I'll put in a request for the crosswalk to be repainted and note that a car made contact with her bag so it gets looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And, um, how long does it usually take, this kind of repair? Days, weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it varies. Paint work depends on the weather, and in February it's usually too cold to stripe. Crews tend to do the lines when it warms up in the spring, but I'll flag it as a safety concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay, I understand. Is the cold, yes. That is fine. Can I leave my number in case they need to ask me something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0175. Nilson Rocha. R-O-C-H-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175, Rocha, R-O-C-H-A. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Now I cross this one off my list. I have a long list today, many errands. After this I go to the hardware store, then the post office, and then I check the boiler at another building. One by one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds like a full day. Thanks for calling, Mr. Rocha. Stay warm out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:26:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. Have a good day."
    }
  ],
